{
  "_readme": "Copy this file to keys.json (which is GITIGNORED - never commit real keys) and paste your free-tier keys. 2-3 Gemini keys recommended: when one hits its per-minute quota the next takes over automatically. Get keys at aistudio.google.com (Gemini) and console.groq.com (Groq). Leave any list empty to skip that provider - the bot then uses local Ollama, and failing that, deterministic template answers. keys.json is HOT-RELOADED: pasted keys take effect within seconds, no server restart needed. Watch the server window for [llm] lines - bad keys are reported there by their last 4 characters.",

